  "event_seq": 91,
  "root_problem": "Since 2026-09-09 the payment gateway has had idempotency-key enforcement disabled (change CHG-77, E-02), so automatic capture retries triggered by gateway timeouts are sent to the PSP without an idempotency key (E-03); the PSP therefore no longer deduplicates these retries and each one creates a genuine second capture, exactly matching gateway timeout-retry counts from that date (E-01), which drove the ~25-30x spike in double-charge support tickets starting week W37 (E-04)."
 },
